        "raw": "<p>Does Devious Disruption remove Attack and Defense tokens from all foes, or just those foes in range and LoS?</p><p>For instance, Baron Blade is fighting the Freedom Five. He&#39;s at elevation 1. Absolute Zero has 2 +defense tokens, is 3 hexes away, and there&#39;s no intervening terrain. Bunker has 3 +attack tokens, is 2 hexes away along a cardinal and at elevation 1, but the intervening hex is elevation 2. Legacy has 3 +attack tokens, is 6 hexes away, but there&#39;s an elevation 4 hex in the way. Tachyon and Wraith each have +2 attack tokens but are 9 hexes away.</p><p>Who loses tokens and how many dice does Baron Blade roll when he uses Devious Disruption?</p>",
